@startuml Room-Lifecycle-State
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 9

title UpDown QnD — Room State Machine\nStates: waiting → countdown → revealing → exchange → finished\n<color:red>BUG: 'finished' is terminal — no path back to 'waiting'</color>

[*] --> waiting : Room created\n(RoomManager.createRoom)

state "waiting" as W #A5D6A7 {
  W : Players can join/leave
  W : Host can add bots
  W : Host can start game
  W : Lobby countdown (30s) may auto-start
}

state "countdown" as CD #FFE082 {
  CD : 10-second round timer
  CD : Players submit guesses (PLAY_CARD)
  CD : Players play special cards
  CD : Timer ticks broadcast to all
}

state "revealing" as RV #FFF3E0 {
  RV : Round resolved
  RV : Scores calculated
  RV : Eliminations processed
  RV : ROUND_RESULT broadcast
}

state "exchange" as EX #E3F2FD {
  EX : 3-second pause between rounds
  EX : Players can JOIN during exchange
  EX : Next round auto-starts after 3s
}

state "finished" as FIN #EF9A9A {
  FIN : GAME_OVER broadcast
  FIN : Leaderboard + diamonds shown
  FIN : <color:red>STATE IS TERMINAL</color>
  FIN : <color:red>No reset back to 'waiting'</color>
}

W --> CD : host.startGame()\n[uc:560d9a46]\nGameRoom.ts:319
W --> CD : lobbyCountdown=0\n(auto-start for preset rooms)

CD --> RV : allPlayed OR timeout\n[uc:b3fb6696] [uc:34620f4b]\nGameRoom.ts:444-445
CD --> FIN : deck empty before round\nGameRoom.ts:326,332

RV --> FIN : alivePlayers === 0\n[uc:38d62fef]\nGameRoom.ts:449
RV --> FIN : deck + gmHand empty\n[uc:e73e7784]\nGameRoom.ts:543
RV --> EX : players alive + cards remain\nGameRoom.ts:546
RV --> CD : solo mode (no exchange)\nGameRoom.ts:549

EX --> CD : after 3s setTimeout\nGameRoom.ts:547-549\nnextRound()

' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' THE BUG: No transition from finished → waiting
' ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

FIN -[#red,dashed]-> W : <color:red>MISSING TRANSITION</color>\n<color:red>resetForReplay() needed</color>

note right of FIN
  **BUG ANALYSIS: Play Again is broken**

  **Current flow (WRONG):**
  1. endGame() sets state='finished'
  2. Client receives GAME_OVER
  3. 'Play Again' button clicked
  4. Client calls leaveRoom() ← WRONG
  5. Client calls joinRoom(sameId) after 500ms
  6. But for user-created rooms:
     - 60s cleanup timer runs
     - Room may be deleted
     - Even if alive, state='finished'
     - addPlayer() rejects: state !== 'waiting'

  **For preset rooms:**
  - autoRecreate deletes & recreates room
  - Same room ID but NEW GameRoom instance
  - Players must re-join (lose chat history)
  - Race condition on 500ms setTimeout

  **Correct flow (SHOULD BE):**
  1. endGame() sets state='finished'
  2. Client receives GAME_OVER
  3. 'Play Again' clicked
  4. Client sends PLAY_AGAIN message
  5. Server: room.resetForReplay()
     - state → 'waiting'
     - reset scores, alive, hands
     - keep players connected
     - keep chat history
  6. Server broadcasts ROOM_RESET
  7. All clients show lobby with same players
  8. Host starts new game when ready
end note

note left of W
  **Join guards (addPlayer):**
  - size >= maxPlayers → reject [R7]
  - state !== 'waiting' AND
    state !== 'exchange' → reject [R9]
  - state === 'exchange' → OK [R8]

  These guards BLOCK replay:
  state='finished' ≠ 'waiting'
  so rejoin after leave FAILS
end note

@enduml
